== About me
I am currently a Ph.D student at [https://www.sysu.edu.cn/ Sun Yat-sen University], where I am advised by [https://chenliang.tech/ Prof. Liang Chen] and [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zWnsNrkAAAAJ&hl=en Prof. Zibin Zheng]. I received the master's degree from Sun Yat-sen University in 2021.

My research interests include: 
- Trustworthy Graph Learning: reliability, fairness, etc.
- Graph Neural Networks
- Large Language Models


*🔥🔥🔥 I am in the 2025 fall job market and actively seeking postdoctoral and industry opportunities. Feel free to reach out to me via email or WeChat (id: EdisonLeejt).*

